# Normalize line endings: the repo lives on both WSL (Linux) and Windows
# checkouts — LF everywhere keeps working trees byte-identical and the
# 2362-test source-pin suite free of CRLF noise. Binaries stay untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png -text
*.jpg -text
*.jpeg -text
*.webp -text
*.gif -text
*.ico -text
*.pdf -text
*.xls -text
*.xlsx -text
*.woff -text
*.woff2 -text
*.ttf -text
